# Turn hands (P0)

Wrong left/right must not ship. Circuit direction is not corner hand (Phillip Island is anticlockwise; Doohan / T1 is a **right**).

## Do

- Allowed hands live in `app/src/data/track_turn_verification.json` (mirror in `android-app/`). Every `left`/`right` needs a `handSources` entry (`rider` | `official_map` | `authoritative_preview`).
- After catalog hand edits: `node scripts/enforce-turn-verification.mjs --write`, copy `tracks.json` to `android-app/`, then `node scripts/validate-track-data.mjs`.
- Stop and ask the user before changing a verified hand.

## Do not

- Set `left`/`right` from GPX bearing, detector output, or clockwise/anticlockwise.
- “Correct” a rider-locked hand from GPX or KB extract.

Implementer playbook: `.cursor/skills/track-details-bake/SKILL.md`.
